---
import SimplePage from "../../../components/SimplePage.astro";
---

<SimplePage
  title="Why Choose Gene Johnson"
  description="Family owned since 1976, upfront pricing, and a fix-it-right guarantee - here's what actually sets Gene Johnson apart from a typical home services company."
  path="/about-us/why-choose-us/"
  eyebrow="Why Choose Us"
  tagline="Anyone can promise good service. Here's what we actually do differently."
  icon="Fixed Right Guarantee"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "About Us", href: "/about-us/" }, { name: "Why Choose Us" }]}
>
  <h2>We show you the price before we start</h2>
  <p>
    You'll always see the price for a job before any work begins - not an hourly rate that leaves the total a mystery until the invoice. If a repair reveals something unexpected, we stop and get your approval before continuing.
  </p>

  <h2>We explain, not just fix</h2>
  <p>
    Every technician is trained to explain what's actually wrong, what your options are, and why we're recommending a specific fix - including when the honest answer is "this doesn't need replacing yet."
  </p>

  <h2>One company for every trade</h2>
  <p>
    Plumbing, heating, cooling, and electrical issues often overlap. Having all four under one company means no finger-pointing between separate contractors and one point of accountability for the whole job.
  </p>

  <h2>We back our work</h2>
  <p>
    If something isn't fixed right, we come back and make it right - that's the standard behind our "we fix it or you don't pay" guarantee. It's not a slogan; it's how every service call is actually structured.
  </p>

  <h2>Still local, still family owned</h2>
  <p>
    Since {new Date().getFullYear() - 1976} years in the Puget Sound area, under the same family ownership. That continuity is why customers who called us in the 1980s are still calling us today.
  </p>
</SimplePage>
